@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Moderator as User
boundary HalamanLaporanUI as LaporanUI
control LaporanController as Controller
entity LaporanProvider as Laporan

== Main Flow ==

User -> LaporanUI : 1: Buka halaman laporan konten
activate LaporanUI
LaporanUI -> Controller : 1.1: muatDaftarLaporan()
activate Controller
Controller -> Laporan : 1.1.1: ambilLaporan()
activate Laporan
Laporan --> Controller : 1.1.2: Daftar laporan
Controller --> LaporanUI : 1.1.3: Data laporan
LaporanUI --> User : 1.1.4: Tampilkan daftar laporan\n(filter All, Pending, Resolved, Rejected)

User -> LaporanUI : 2: Pilih salah satu laporan untuk ditinjau
LaporanUI -> Controller : 2.1: muatDetailLaporan(laporanId)
Controller -> Laporan : 2.1.1: ambilDetailLaporan(laporanId)
Laporan --> Controller : 2.1.2: Detail laporan lengkap
Controller --> LaporanUI : 2.1.3: Data detail laporan
LaporanUI --> User : 2.1.4: Tampilkan detail laporan lengkap\nbeserta tombol aksi Terima dan Tolak

User -> LaporanUI : 3: Tinjau artikel yang dilaporkan

alt [Moderator menekan tombol Terima Laporan]
    User -> LaporanUI : 4: Klik tombol Terima Laporan
    LaporanUI -> Controller : 4.1: terimaLaporan(laporanId)
    Controller --> LaporanUI : 4.1.1: Laporan diterima
    LaporanUI --> User : 4.1.2: Notifikasi sukses
else [Moderator menekan tombol Tolak Laporan]
    User -> LaporanUI : 4a: Klik tombol Tolak Laporan
    LaporanUI -> Controller : 4a.1: tolakLaporan(laporanId)
    Controller --> LaporanUI : 4a.1.1: Laporan ditolak
    LaporanUI --> User : 4a.1.2: Notifikasi sukses
else [Artikel sudah dihapus]
    Laporan --> Controller : 2.1.2a: Artikel tidak ditemukan
    Controller --> LaporanUI : 2.1.3a: Error
    LaporanUI --> User : 2.1.4a: Pesan "Artikel tidak ditemukan"
end

deactivate Laporan
deactivate Controller
deactivate LaporanUI

@enduml
